---
source: src/app/keymap.rs
expression: "help.join(\"\\n\")"
---
       j k  next / previous
       g G  first / last
   tab h l  switch pane
     enter  open
       esc  back / clear
       n p  next / prev (reader)
       s f  toggle read / flag
       a d  archive / delete
       m y  move / copy to…
       x V  mark / mark all
         T  thread view
         C  compact rows
         c  compose
       r R  reply / reply all
         F  forward
         e  edit draft
       o S  open / save attachments
       L B  links / open in browser
         H  message source
         /  search
    ctrl-r  refresh
     n R D  new / rename / delete
         A  switch account
         q  quit
